      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a rational choice to step back from the tragedy, but you can also choose to stay in the front row and help the fire burn a little less cold. The point isn't to fix the whole world in one go, but to make your own presence a part of the story that matters. You don't have to be a hero; just be someone who stays, watches, and keeps the fire from going out completely.",
